{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48883","headline":"寄友人乞菊栽 · 李郢","name":"寄友人乞菊栽","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"药阑经雨正堪锄，白菊烦君乞数株。\n潘岳赋中芳思在，陶潜篱下绿英无。\n移来稍及蝉鸣树，种罢长教酒满壶。\n□子成仙纵难学，九秋思看集鸠雏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48883.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48883","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}